      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Behind the scenes",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A very",
            "accent": "well-kept secret."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Jassi had been planning this for a long time. He and his partner had come from Britain and were staying at a beautiful villa belonging to good friends of mine in Conca. The view alone was enough to make you stop talking.",
            "We arranged everything in advance. The owner called to explain when and how I could slip inside without being seen. We chose a moment before the couple left for their planned excursion, and I waited behind the farthest corner of the villa."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / The question",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "Everything happens",
        "accent": "at once."
