      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "The question",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Everything happens",
            "accent": "at once."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "She came outside without suspecting a thing. First there was the table, the wine, the view. Then Jassi began his proposal, and I was already in position with my camera, photographing every second.",
            "The frames follow one another so closely that, together, they almost move. But it is the expressions I keep coming back to: surprise, excitement, and the way they looked at each other."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
