          "eyebrow": "After the yes",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Time to",
            "accent": "take it in."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Afterwards they had a little wine and began to relax. We photographed the ring, the flowers around the villa, and the two of them enjoying a moment that no longer needed to be kept secret.",
            "Some sessions stay with me for a long time. The careful preparation, that extraordinary terrace, and the emotion of the proposal made this one impossible to forget."
